  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "3 teaspoons baking powder",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "0.75 cup white sugar",
    "1 egg",
    "1 cup milk",
    "0.25 cup vegetable oil"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C). Grease a 12-cup muffin tin or line cups with paper liners.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5JnWJPAU7SelyEh4tG3TcPJ0zHw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6874-Best-Ever-Muffins-DDMFS-Step-01a-1345-9c8cfee42ea84a229c5796f20bffc4b2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6874/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir flour, baking powder, salt, and sugar together in a large bowl; make a well in the center.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HQo0DFH_ClYBt-5a_FPvDeU-evw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6874-Best-Ever-Muffins-DDMFS-Step-02-1347-9864cea4558841b2b2c66eca4e86ddbe.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6874/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat egg with a fork in a small bowl or 2-cup measuring cup; whisk in milk and oil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/z_zFHk9s2xeuDMdcYFbeaUbKFck=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6874-Best-Ever-Muffins-DDMFS-Step-03-1348-885a5ee0ef8b4445995e6d0d0e10d5e7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6874/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour egg mixture all at once into flour mixture; mix quickly and lightly with a fork until just moistened. The batter will be lumpy. (Fold in additional ingredients if using; see variations below).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1cxARZ5pDg3bM6mj-eo1avbRQ90=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6874-Best-Ever-Muffins-DDMFS-Step-04-1349-9c6542893881429aa03e00cf526f7e81.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6874/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon batter into the prepared muffin cups, filling each 3/4 full.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mbDJINEgDYIN9VWCYJm7AdJNGrQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6874-Best-Ever-Muffins-DDMFS-Step-06-1350-14ff11e2c20a4300a96600f3c339dc5f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6874/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until tops spring back when lightly pressed, about 25 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Xe4b7KpcCZGFmBES2ZgiEehSavs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6874-Best-Ever-Muffins-DDMFS-Step-07-1360-886ae05f6918489daee58c98fc103d25.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6874/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy! Get back to basics with this top-rated muffin recipe that comes together easily with kitchen staples.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2N4nB0qbWKcIka_wxaPazzFrPgY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6874-Best-Ever-Muffins-DDMFS-4x3-1388-1f15dbdcaf7b4141bc8eafb91cb9ada3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6874/step_07.webp"
    }
